medium/meta/coach/
.claude/agents/

# Nested git worktrees under .claude/worktrees/. These were previously
# committed as gitlinks (mode 160000) pointing at commits that do not
# exist in this repo, which broke `git submodule status`, `git fsck`
# and fresh clones. Ignore them everywhere so they can never be re-added.
**/.claude/worktrees/

# Private interview stories (never commit)
medium/katalon/*_PRIVATE.md

