data-engineering/data-engineering-course/aws_snowflake_dbt_course/dbt_project/target/
data-engineering/data-engineering-course/aws_snowflake_dbt_course/dbt_project/dbt_packages/
data-engineering/data-engineering-course/aws_snowflake_dbt_course/dbt_project/logs/
